# The jc image build context is the repository root (bins/jc/Dockerfile). Only sources and
# manifests go in: build output, local installs and git history stay out, so a rebuild's
# context is small and `COPY . .` is invalidated only by source changes.
.git
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/ui/dist
**/sdk/dist
**/.cg
**/.codegraph
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
